        }
      ],
      "impact": "Without a DC pull-up, Q2's gate can float when the SKW92A GPIO is high-impedance, so the display power rail may not be reliably off and the MOSFET can partially turn on or leak.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "category": "wrong_value",
